  "title": "The Minimum Number of Coprime Adjacencies in a Permutation",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of the exact minimum number of coprime adjacent pairs over all permutations of the first n positive integers, valid unconditionally for every n at least four. The proof constructs optimal paths in the graph joining noncoprime integers.",
